  },
  {
   "id": "d2476be8-497f-427e-a46a-9afd04de7e0f",
   "build_id": "86d44d4a-a868-403c-b33b-82b75ca904ca",
   "author_id": "2f07a215-aa84-490e-8013-deb1e0d4462b",
   "parent_id": null,
   "body": "I think for some players, in the class tree regarding PVP utility swapping out Double the pace (10% party haste and 2% personal crit) OR Hightened Senses (reduced adrenaline rush cost and increased speed on use) for Snatch for the disarm against the bully/tanky melee classes can make a bigger impact with the dueling. Also swapping for getting Knockout for similar reasons could be beneficial.",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-23T19:04:15.047754+00:00",
